Roughly speaking, the world consists of three overlayed strata. The base layer is the [[Phenomena/Aetheric Field|Aetheric Field]] -- a heterogeneous distribution of energy everywhere across the [[Geography/index|Astra]]. Laid atop that is the [[Phenomena/Weave|Weave]], an interface layer that provides an energy sink for the aether. Finally, the third layer is the [[Phenomena/YuDaan's Nine-fold Treatise|Enneract]], the space-time-spirit continuum upon which the entire world is built.
